title The synthesis round of the stopped fleet -- %346 books the inherited word, the debride runs, and a stopped hand's send completes
prompt With every loop stopped, Keaton called a synthesis round as Sound: Dream closed clean (tally stack both sides, roster 9 of 11 covered), Hush closed clean (pond user duty, three findings handed to this seat), Silence stalled twenty minutes in a fusion-less full re-verify and was interrupted with a finished signed commit unpushed, Mind waits on its one-paste, and he pointed at fa34b7a43's child-stream subject as the day's second vocabulary red under his standing molt-breach word.
think %346 booked into the pin (the second row of its healed life): the retired word arrived BY INHERITANCE -- the elder comment under edit said child-stream and the editor propagated it into a subject, a body, and fresh comments -- so the teaching is that a retired word slips past its own banner when it arrives as quotation, and sweep-on-touch covers the words a lap copies forward. Eight living hits swept across rishi/src/main.rye and tools/l/chatgpt-mind.rish; identifiers and std.process seam names keep Zig's words; directory-child refusal strings keep their different sense; the one behavior string changed (the interrupt line) rode a rebuild.
think The captain's completion: Silence's interrupted commit be976e422 -- the dual-stack row seat, signed at 18:37, six files -- stood local-only on this shared checkout with only the fusion-less re-verify left undone. Bounded verification stood in for the twenty-minute roster: its lane witness tally-roster GREEN on this tree, its two derived pages regenerated by its own amend, its close having read 91 of 93 pre-interrupt. It rides the rewritten history rather than being pushed separately, so one force carries both seats' work.
think The debride, by the seated pattern: checkpoint be976e4227 landed first; the rewrite runs message-only over fa34b7a43~1..HEAD (child-stream to dependent-stream in the one subject and body), re-signing every commit, the tree held byte-identical at 56828d1bcadb, then both remotes take the force on Keaton's word naming the commit. All loops being stopped makes the window clean; grain-mind recovers by reset (its stashes are refs and survive), and every loop clone self-heals at its next fleet_round_open, which resets to the anointed order by design.
obs The synthesis the reply carries, in one line each: the sameness arc landed whole (door, shims, engine, orchestrators, all parity-proven); door B healed the ledger and the ledger booked three reds the same evening, which is what a ledger is for; Mind's three walls fell in sequence (harness, arithmetic, interpreter) and each fix was proven both ways; the day's recurring wound is %291 in four spellings, and its cure -- one tree per star -- is now urgent rather than architectural; Silence's stall names the fusion build as the fleet's next crux (a twenty-minute re-verify tax on every rebased send); Hush's xargs -r finding and the nib-pin tension are seated doors; the always-fleet design waits whole on one word.
